{start_of_verse label="Verse 1"}
[G]Love, oh love, oh careless [D7]love,
Love, oh love, oh careless [G]love,
Love, oh [G7]love, oh careless [C]love,
You [G]see what careless [D7]love has [G]done.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 2"}
[G]Once I wore my apron [D7]low,
Once I wore my apron [G]low,
Once I [G7]wore my apron [C]low,
You'd [G]follow me through [D7]rain and [G]snow.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 3"}
[G]Now my apron strings won't [D7]pin,
Now my apron strings won't [G]pin,
Now my [G7]apron strings won't [C]pin,
You [G]pass my door and [D7]won't come [G]in.
{end_of_verse}
{x_end: G}
